- Public API remains unchanged (added delegation method for compatibility)
- Improved type safety with mypy validation
- No breaking changes to functionality

The refactoring successfully addresses the code smells while maintaining all existing functionality and improving the code's maintainability, testability, and adherence to SOLID principles.
